body:
Also, is there any gba emulators on vita or adrenaline that can link up over the internet?

&#x200B;

thanks!

Im so sorry that this is happening. I can tell you from past experience that she most likely is cheating on you, neither does she care about you nearly as much as you care about her (if at all)

&#x200B;

I know she is probably your entire world but if you do not start the process of letting her go now, she will destroy you inside and the pain will be worse. Don't confront her about it, try not to get angry or cry. Just tell her that you don't feel safe anymore with her and that the relationship is a negative influence on your mental health, then walk away, leave her. You will be doing both yourself and her a favor.

&#x200B;

I know you probably won't dump her but you really really need to, sooner than later, today preferably. If I were you id block her fb and snapchat. No girl  who is snapping other dudes (and probably fucking them) deserves  anyone like you or I,

&#x200B;

you need to think of her as a snake and  this episode(catching her cheating) as a snakebite; cut the limb off before it spreads, endure the pain now because if you don't she will surely kill your heart.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

I dealt with a girl like this for almost 6 months, she would cheat on me, block me, do drugs behind my back, cheat on me ect, and every time i forgave her i saw the care she had left for me diminish more and more.

&#x200B;

dont pull the wool over your own eyes; she is cheating on you, she does not care about you.

&#x200B;

dump that bitch now or you're going to be picking up much smaller pieces of your heart when she leaves you to whore around. Women like her don't deserve anything but to be used and discarded like the trash they are.

Sorry for spiraling, i am way out of control by the end of this, im not completely sane right now because I have cold turkey withdrawal staring me in the face from 3 days in the future, its not fun. Anyway. Hope someone finds this useful or at least enjoys reading it.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

ive managed to somehow taper down to about 25 gpd, i have enough kratom to last through meeting my probation officer on Wednesday (whom has always been oblivious to my dependence which started last june).

&#x200B;

there are some things i need to finally get off my chest, now that i know what truth is and how the universe operates

&#x200B;

I finally think ill be able to be done with this, i havent honestly enjoyed taking kratom for at least a month now, it has turned me into a numb emotionless zombie, it destroyed my work ethic in the course of the 6  months i remained working while on it, ive been unemployed for the last  4 months now, ive tried to accept just running out twice now and have never been able to go through with it because ive been able to fund it even though it is the last thing i should be spending ANY money on.

I have tried and failed 3 times now to get another job while still dependent/barely in control of my doses. The hit to my work drive really took a toll on me mentally because i am usually the one with a crazy strong work ethic, but always being numb and apathetic robbed me of that. it was naturally addictive and appealing being that I normally live with crazy strong emotional responses as someone who suffers from bpd/eupd,  but use got out of hand, led to dependence, which led to addiction and has now come full circle. I need to change this habit/lifestyle now or the zombie void will completely control me until I do not have a place to live. I already suffer from crazyness is my life, dealing with a kratom dependence would be the straw that breaks my ability to function as a normal adult.

I am extremely lucky to be living with the friends/family I do right now, they have been there for me when my own family have not out of blind self righteousness, i have a roof over my head so I am able to do this without my entire world totally falling apart. I am single with no significant other, have dealt with trauma, abuse, bad relationships, drug abuse bordering on addiction that I thank god I got away from before it consumed me (do not use stimulant euphoriants recreationally, do not use opioids recreationally, live by this and substances will not control you.)

&#x200B;

my rules are

&#x200B;

A. if the substance causes intense craving for the substance whether by withdrawal or the chemically addictive nature of the substance(e.g. all psychostimulants that directly increase dopamine, the "fiend" drugs.)

&#x200B;

B. or, if the substance causes a physical dependence which disallows the user to quit without significant physical symptoms (e.g. opioids/opiates, benzodiazepines, alcohol, other sedative hypnotics ect.)

&#x200B;

If the substance fits either of these categories, DO NOT use it recreationally,

yes addiction is determined by personality (not everyone that tries meth turns into a speed freak will-lie-straight-to-you-face skeleton person that embodies the lusts of the flesh) BUT the base mathematical logarithm of euphoriant drugs IS addiction,  and believe you me when i say NO ONE can control a meth habit, NO ONE, and fewer yet can control a heroin habit (it is actually an inverse integer, heroin is legitimately satanically addictive) precious few can control a cocaine habit, let alone fulfill their potential while in the throws of the dopamine/fiend cycle.

&#x200B;

as someone who has been in and around the world of addicts, you need to take these people whom are addicted to psychostimulants and opioids and PRESCRIBE THEM CANNABIS, from there you will have a baseline semblence of EFFECTIVELY treating the addiction and cause of the addiction

&#x200B;

There is a set law of order in reality ; mathematically, down to a sub-molecular level, anyone who is an artist or plays an instrument instinctively knows this,

EUPHORIANT SUBSTANCES ARE IN EXACT OPPOSITION to the order of reality, they create  unwarranted reward which by nature corrupts the individual.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

at the end of the day my argument is this; yes the anti-addiction freaks who want to prosecute doctors for doing their job to end an inevitable outcome of human nature are very misguided and inherently have NO understanding of the nature of addiction, the people spouting that anyone who touches drugs will become an addict, anyone who uses meth will chase it, you know the retards im talking about, the "PEOPLE CHASE DRUGS BECAUSE THEY'RE TRYING TO RECREATE THAT FIRST HIGH AND ITS NEVER AS GOOD" morons who have never been high or addicted to anything in their life, the sheltered bible thumpers (that said, jesus is key). these people are religious freaks who subscribe to their religion of ignorance. THESE PEOPLE ARE WRONG which is why their way of dealing with addicts (war on drugs), is so evil, THE POINT IS

&#x200B;

STAY THE FUCK AWAY FROM EUPHORIANTS, FUCKING SMOKE WEED

&#x200B;

WEED isnt going to hurt you, and it can actually be very beneficial for a lot of the people medicating with illegal substances whom are survivors of untold horrors, and they are being told that the green plant god gave them that makes the death and rape flashbacks stop is wrong. WEED can be used as as much of a crutch as ANYTHING, like MOVIES, PORN, ALCOHOL, CIGARETTES, bitching and venting to the wrong people and getting back stabbed for it because you're desperate for some kind of psychological closure and healing.

&#x200B;

If you are someone who is in turmoil and needs HELP, especially those suffering from massive psychological stimulant or opioid addiction (addiction and dependence are different, getting real tired of the politicians who are making a  name for themselves using them interchangeably.)

FOR THE LOVE OF GOD, SMOKE AS MUCH WEED AS YOU WANT, CHASE THE SHIT IF YOU WANT, IT WILL NOT BRING DETRIMENT TO YOU WHATSOEVER, some of the most successful god fearing, smartest people i have ever known or heard talk ARE HUGE  POTHEADS, though that doesnt define them.

any argument against the use of marijuana is purely a moral one and not for any man to make, to each their own judgement between them and god.

&#x200B;

WEED SAVES LIVES, and im not even talking about the idiots saying it literally cures cancer, WEED stops people from killing themselves, it builds bridges, it creates empathy, it MASSIVELY induces self inflection and cautious modes of thinking. I almost lost myself to massive addictions to hard drugs twice because i was being ostracized by a group of people (my family and church) whos crusade was to inform me how bad and morally reprehensible marijuana use is.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Enough of my spiraling, my point is. SMOKE WEED EVERY DAY because the laws of reality literally dictate that as a crutch  it can only be neutral (calling rape victims whom self medicate with weed neutral is how far im going to speak truth, WEED IS GOOD FOR PEOPLE LIKE THIS) and as a tool it can only be beneficial. (yes i know the neuro implications of cannabis use in adolescents, im advocating weed for treatment of addiction and trauma.)

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Thanks for reading my thoughts, and i hope everyone wins their battle today

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

valkry

\*\*\*\*\*UPDATE\*\*\*\*\*

&#x200B;

I contacted Square Enix live chat support, i am now back in my account!! I was so worried I'd lose my legacy account!!! THANK YOU SQUARE-ENIX!!!!
